        "Emma's Birthday party",
        "艾玛的生日派对"
    ],
    "content": {
        "sentences": [
            [
                "Emma Haywood is a seventh-grade girl with blonde hair who lives in a small seaside town.",
                "艾玛·海伍德是一个有着金发的七年级女孩，住在一个海边小镇。"
            ],
            [
                "She is always friendly to others.",
                "她总是对他人很友善。"
            ],
            [
                "Years ago, she became interested in sailing.",
                "几年前，她对帆船运动产生了兴趣。"
            ],
            [
                "Afterwards, she was allowed to take part in a competition and won first prize.",
                "后来，她被允许参加比赛并获得了一等奖。"
            ],
            [
                "Last Saturday was Emma's 13th birthday.",
                "上周六是艾玛的13岁生日。"
            ],
            [
                "Her parents decided to hold a surprise party for Emma, who would be a teenager.",
                "她的父母决定为将成为青少年的艾玛举办一个惊喜派对。"
            ],
            [
                "They asked her best friends John and Harriet, who are also their neighbours, for help.",
                "他们向她最好的朋友约翰和哈丽特求助，他们也是她的邻居。"
            ],
            [
                "\"John, could you give Emma a call and ask her to go to the beach on Saturday morning?\" asked Mr. Haywood on the phone.",
                "「约翰，你能给艾玛打个电话，让她周六早上去海滩吗？」海伍德先生在电话里问道。"
            ],
            [
                "\"After she left the house, Harriet would come and help us with the cake and balloons.\"",
                "「她离开家后，哈丽特会来帮我们做蛋糕和气球。」"
            ],
            [
                "\"Certainly!\" John answered in an excited voice.",
               "「当然可以！」约翰兴奋地回答。"
            ],
            [
                "On that day, Emma came back home and she was so surprised and happy to hear all her family and friends shouting out \"Happy birthday!\" and singing a birthday song for her.",
                "那天，艾玛回到家，听到所有家人和朋友高呼「生日快乐！」并为她唱生日歌，她既惊讶又开心。"
            ],
            [
                "\"It's time for you to make a wish, my kid.\" Mrs. Haywood showed up with a chocolate cake and gently kissed her forehead.",
                "「该许愿了，我的孩子。」海伍德夫人端着巧克力蛋糕出现，轻轻吻了吻她的额头。"
            ],
            [
                "\"First thank you all for coming here.\" Emma looked at everyone with a smile.",
                "「首先感谢大家来到这里。」艾玛微笑着看着大家。"
            ],
            [
                "\"Now it's time for my wish.\"",
                "「现在该我许愿了。」"
            ],
            [
                "\"I hope my dream of being an Olympic champion will come true,\" thought Emma, with her eyes closed and hands folded.",
               "「我希望成为奥运会冠军的梦想能够实现，」艾玛闭上眼睛，双手合十地想道。"
            ],
            [
                "Then she blew out all the candles.",
                "然后她吹灭了所有的蜡烛。"
            ],
            [
                "Emma's parents and friends gave her many lovely gifts.",
                "艾玛的父母和朋友给了她许多可爱的礼物。"
            ],
            [
                "They enjoyed the food and played games together happily for the whole afternoon.",
                "整个下午他们一起享用食物、玩游戏，非常开心。"
            ],
            [
                "\"What an interesting day! It is my best birthday memory,\" wrote Emma in her diary.",
                "「多么有趣的一天！这是我最美好的生日回忆，」艾玛在日记中写道。"
            ]
        ]
    },
